{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ObservableSubcategory","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableSubcategory.ofSection_observable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory.ofSection_observable","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ObservableSubcategory.lean#L55-L58","doc":"Sanity: in a section-induced subcategory, `S` is observable iff its\nsection is non-zero — by construction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableSubcategory.ofSection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory.ofSection","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ObservableSubcategory.lean#L43-L53","doc":"**De-axiomatisation (bean `tps9`).** The observability predicate is not a\nfree axiom: every degree-0 section `A₀ : C → ℝ` canonically *induces* the\nobservable subcategory, with membership *defined* as its non-vanishing.\nThe carrier's `observable_iff` is then `Iff.rfl`, so `Bun°` is genuinely\n\"the non-vanishing locus of `Γ(−, A₀)`\", not an assumed criterion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableSubcategory.not_observable_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory.not_observable_iff","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ObservableSubcategory.lean#L36-L41","doc":"The complement `Bun ∖ Bun°` is exactly the `A₀ = 0` locus (jet horizons\nand big-bang states) — manuscript \"Complement\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableSubcategory.observable_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory.observable_iff","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ObservableSubcategory.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Defining identity: `𝒮 ∈ Bun°` iff its degree-0 section is non-zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableSubcategory.isObservable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory.isObservable","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ObservableSubcategory.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Membership in the observable subcategory `Bun°`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableSubcategory.A0section","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory.A0section","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ObservableSubcategory.lean#L28-L28","doc":"The degree-0 section `Γ(𝒮, A₀)` (scalar proxy; observability turns on\nits non-vanishing). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableSubcategory.Obj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory.Obj","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ObservableSubcategory.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Objects of the ambient bundle category `Bun(ℙ(V))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableSubcategory.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ObservableSubcategory.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableSubcategory","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableSubcategory","kind":"structure","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ObservableSubcategory.lean#L17-L32","doc":"Data for the observable subcategory `Bun°(ℙ(V))`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: `Obj` are the objects of the ambient bundle\ncategory, `A0section 𝒮` is the degree-0 section `Γ(𝒮, A₀)` (its\nnon-vanishing is the observability criterion), and `isObservable` is the\nmembership predicate, pinned to `A0section 𝒮 ≠ 0`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:observable-subcategory","label":"def:observable-subcategory","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/observable-subcategory.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}